        "content": "id: \"117043346514398510\"\nplatform: mastodon\npage: Mastodon@mastodon.social\ntitle: \"@Mastodon: We're excited to share the results from Mastodon's first #DiscoveryWeek! In case\"\nbody: \"We're excited to share the results from Mastodon's first #DiscoveryWeek!\\nIn case you missed it, earlier this year our Head of Design @imanijoy arranged a week of workshops and surveys to get to know you, learn about your needs and wants, and discover how you're using (and want to use) Mastodon.\\nThis week was tremendously helpful for us, and we're grateful to everyone who participated.\\nHere's what we learned:\\nhttps://blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/08/discovery-week-2026-what-we-learned-and-what-were-doing-next/\\n#Mastodon #Fediverse #SocialWeb #OpenSocial\"\nauthor: Mastodon\nauthor_display_name: Mastodon\nauthor_avatar_url: \"https://files.mastodon.social/accounts/avatars/000/013/179/original/b4ceb19c9c54ec7e.png\"\nurl: \"https://mastodon.social/@Mastodon/117043346514398510\"\npublished_at: \"2026-08-05T14:22:15.639Z\"\nreply_count: 12\nrepost_count: 159\nlike_count: 226\nmedia_url: null\nthumbnail_url: null\nexternal_url: \"https://blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/08/discovery-week-2026-what-we-learned-and-what-were-doing-next/\"\nexternal_title: \"Discovery Week 2026: What we learned, and what we’re doing next\"\ncomments: []\nfetched_comment_count: 0\nprovider: Mastodon\nembed_ref: mastodon-we-re-Abz\napp_id: social_media\nskill_id: get-posts",
