        "content": "id: \"117015608750780726\"\nplatform: mastodon\npage: Mastodon@mastodon.social\ntitle: \"@Mastodon: @TheRealPomax Great suggestion, thank you! We're putting that line in bold text\"\nbody: \"@TheRealPomax Great suggestion, thank you! We're putting that line in bold text now, and if you haven't already, you should receive an email with more details and a link to the new terms soon.\"\nauthor: Mastodon\nauthor_display_name: Mastodon\nauthor_avatar_url: \"https://files.mastodon.social/accounts/avatars/000/013/179/original/b4ceb19c9c54ec7e.png\"\nurl: \"https://mastodon.social/@Mastodon/117015608750780726\"\npublished_at: \"2026-07-31T16:48:10.955Z\"\nreply_count: 1\nrepost_count: 1\nlike_count: 2\nmedia_url: null\nthumbnail_url: null\nexternal_url: null\nexternal_title: null\ncomments[1]{id,author,author_display_name,body,url,published_at,like_count,reply_count,repost_count}:\n  \"117015642214260225\",TheRealPomax,Pomax,\"@Mastodon yep, just got the email, which is how I ended up on the blog post.\",\"https://mastodon.social/@TheRealPomax/117015642214260225\",\"2026-07-31T16:56:41.565Z\",0,0,0\nfetched_comment_count: 1\nprovider: Mastodon\nembed_ref: mastodon-therealpomax-great-sW0\napp_id: social_media\nskill_id: get-posts",
