        "content": "id: \"117083691112770390\"\nplatform: mastodon\npage: Mastodon@mastodon.social\ntitle: \"@Mastodon: Today we're sharing additional guidelines about our Trade Mark Policy based on c\"\nbody: \"Today we're sharing additional guidelines about our Trade Mark Policy based on community feedback that we received.\\nThe new guidelines, and more background about these changes, are available on our blog:\\nhttps://blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/08/sharing-guidelines-about-mastodons-trade-mark-policy/\\n#Mastodon #Fediverse #SocialWeb #FediDev #MastoDev #FediAdmin #MastoAdmin\"\nauthor: Mastodon\nauthor_display_name: Mastodon\nauthor_avatar_url: \"https://files.mastodon.social/accounts/avatars/000/013/179/original/b4ceb19c9c54ec7e.png\"\nurl: \"https://mastodon.social/@Mastodon/117083691112770390\"\npublished_at: \"2026-08-12T17:22:25.361Z\"\nreply_count: 21\nrepost_count: 85\nlike_count: 110\nmedia_url: null\nthumbnail_url: null\nexternal_url: \"https://blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/08/sharing-guidelines-about-mastodons-trade-mark-policy/\"\nexternal_title: Sharing Guidelines about Mastodon’s Trade Mark Policy\ncomments[5]{id,author,author_display_name,body,url,published_at,like_count,reply_count,repost_count}:\n  \"117083694767249113\",Mastodon,Mastodon,\"Our Community Director @haubles provided a \\\"plain English\\\" version too:\\nhttps://hachyderm.io/@haubles/117083650941891878\",\"https://mastodon.social/@Mastodon/117083694767249113\",\"2026-08-12T17:23:21.125Z\",70,0,27\n  \"117083727962609466\",bazkie@beige.party,surely bazkie 👩🏼💻,\"@Mastodon you don't have shit to say about that kind of thing, it's decentralized.\\nyou shouldn't exist as a company\",\"https://beige.party/@bazkie/117083727834137295\",\"2026-08-12T17:31:45.000Z\",16,2,0\n  \"117093011192023613\",xvilo@mastodon.org.uk,\"Sem Schilder :t_blink:\",@bazkie @Mastodon that’s not how that works obviously,\"https://mastodon.org.uk/@xvilo/117093011085365998\",\"2026-08-14T08:52:36.000Z\",0,2,0\n  \"117093395066517892\",bazkie@beige.party,surely bazkie 👩🏼💻,@xvilo @Mastodon suck some more corporate dick,\"https://beige.party/@bazkie/117093394880154664\",\"2026-08-14T10:30:13.000Z\",4,1,0\n  \"117093520999270461\",xvilo,Sem Schilder,\"@bazkie @xvilo@mastodon.org.uk @Mastodon Dus je comment deze opbouwende reactie, maar blocked mij direct? Gelukkig federeren we mooi op een gedecentraliseerd systeem. Als jij je niet blij bent met wat mastodon doet, dan kan je natuurlijk iets anders gebruik om alsnog aan de fediverse te hangen. Dit soort taal is absoluut niet opbouwend, en voegt ook niks toe aan de discussie.\",\"https://mastodon.social/@xvilo/117093520999270461\",\"2026-08-14T11:02:17.660Z\",2,1,0\nfetched_comment_count: 5\nprovider: Mastodon\nembed_ref: mastodon-today-we-jTv\napp_id: social_media\nskill_id: get-posts",
