        "content": "id: \"117117221397911074\"\nplatform: mastodon\npage: Mastodon@mastodon.social\ntitle: \"@Mastodon: After publishing the results of Discovery Week, we can now give you a first snea\"\nbody: \"After publishing the results of Discovery Week, we can now give you a first sneak peak at Mastodon 5.0, our next big version. It will bring a new visual look to your screens, a refreshed and calmer layout, as well as a new composer.\\nhttps://blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/08/5.0-laying-the-foundation/\\n#mastodon #mastodon5.0\"\nauthor: Mastodon\nauthor_display_name: Mastodon\nauthor_avatar_url: \"https://files.mastodon.social/accounts/avatars/000/013/179/original/b4ceb19c9c54ec7e.png\"\nurl: \"https://mastodon.social/@Mastodon/117117221397911074\"\npublished_at: \"2026-08-18T15:29:36.902Z\"\nreply_count: 134\nrepost_count: 574\nlike_count: 961\nmedia_url: null\nthumbnail_url: null\nexternal_url: \"https://blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/08/5.0-laying-the-foundation/\"\nexternal_title: \"5.0: Laying the foundation\"\ncomments[5]{id,author,author_display_name,body,url,published_at,like_count,reply_count,repost_count}:\n  \"117117243837071506\",grymas1000lecia@101010.pl,\"Adi :apple_inc:\",@Mastodon Looks dope!,\"https://101010.pl/@grymas1000lecia/117117243787523984\",\"2026-08-18T15:35:18.000Z\",3,0,1\n  \"117117253204748361\",fabian@mainz.social,\"Fabian Köster :natenom:\",\"@Mastodon Looks great, looking forward to this!\",\"https://mainz.social/@fabian/117117253112606054\",\"2026-08-18T15:37:40.000Z\",3,0,0\n  \"117117258105671885\",phi@kif.rocks,φ,\"@Mastodon please add the \\\"plan post\\\" option to the post composer. It annoys me that I have to use a third party application to do that even though it's supported by Mastodon itself.\",\"https://toot.kif.rocks/@phi/117117257998868084\",\"2026-08-18T15:38:55.000Z\",44,2,4\n  \"117118575452712049\",KayOhtie@blimps.xyz,Kay Ohtie,\"@phi @Mastodon + :1000: to this. I'd love to have that built-in since it already exists server-side. I know I can run Elk separately but if we're making UI improvements to stock, adding that should be one of them.\",\"https://blimps.xyz/@KayOhtie/117118575414402270\",\"2026-08-18T21:13:57.000Z\",2,0,0\n  \"117124173583942935\",MonkeyPanic@nerdculture.de,\"MonkeyPanic! :startrek:\",\"@phi @Mastodon yes, this\",\"https://nerdculture.de/@MonkeyPanic/117124173522244681\",\"2026-08-19T20:57:37.000Z\",0,0,0\nfetched_comment_count: 5\nprovider: Mastodon\nembed_ref: mastodon-after-publishing-2LX\napp_id: social_media\nskill_id: get-posts",
